¿Qué imprime este código?
```python
from typing import Protocol, runtime_checkable
@runtime_checkable
class Speaker(Protocol):
    def speak(self, lang: str) -> str: ...
class Parrot:
    def speak(self) -> str: return "hola"
print(isinstance(Parrot(), Speaker))
```

